  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15.3333px; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposed ground floor extension, by reason of its size, depth, bulk, and siting, would result in overly large and dominant extension that fails to respect the character of the host building and the area generally and which would result in an unacceptable loss of outlook and would have an overbearing impact on the occupants of no. 18 Bergholt Crescent, to the detriment of the amenities of these neighbouring occupants. As such, the proposed development is contrary to policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character), and LP2 (Development and Amenity) of the LP33 Hackney Local Plan (2020), and policies D3 (Optimsiing site capacity through the design-led approach), (D4 (Delivering good design) and D6 (Housing quality and standards) of the London Plan (2021) and Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2009).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
